<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/18/eng@/~cl_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) Notwithstanding subsection (1), the Minister may direct the Commission to support a national universal service provision initiative relating to the usage of network services or applications services or both by encouraging the installation of network facilities and the provision of network services or applications services or both for the preservation of national security where the determination of national security shall be made by the National Security Council in accordance with section 4 of the National Security Council Act 2016 [Act 776]. (1b) Any national universal service provision initiative under subsection (1a) shall be consistent with the objects of this Act.”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/18/eng@> .
